      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 1,
        "impression_count": 3423,
        "like_count": 24,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 10,
        "retweet_count": 4
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2123641309873516780",
          "type": "quoted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "A beautiful showcase of what Kling 4.0's 4K, 10-bit HDR can do. Thanks @kraqvoid for putting it to the test! ✨ 💙#Kling4 #KlingAI https://t.co/gJTZ4H2Utk",
      "url": "https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2123665013768606070"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1799294856822673408",
      "created_at": "2026-11-20T05:44:11.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123653613260317023"
      ],
      "id": "2123653613260317023",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 2,
        "impression_count": 3803,
        "like_count": 44,
        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 10,
        "retweet_count": 1
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2123338066920157434",
          "type": "quoted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Only an 8K image can be sliced into 20 pieces and still show this much detail. 🔍\n\nLove this creative way by @magnific  to showcase images generated with Kling Image 4.0! #KlingImage4 #KlingAI https://t.co/IGUT9VPsiB",
      "url": "https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2123653613260317023"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1001114465692200960",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T19:51:45.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123504522140266636"
      ],
      "id": "2123504522140266636",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 2124,
        "like_count": 11,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 6
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2123504510312300616",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Praxis-1 is a 27B-parameter mixture-of-experts diffusion transformer that predicts video and actions together. We detail the model's architecture, training stages and results in our technical report.\nhttps://t.co/5T3RnNEsd1",
      "url": "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2123504522140266636"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1001114465692200960",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T19:51:42.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123504510312300616"
      ],
      "id": "2123504510312300616",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 2219,
        "like_count": 8,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 2
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2123504468822303117",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "It also learns new tasks from very little data. With under 30 minutes of teleoperated demos, Praxis-1 succeeded in all 15 simulated trials on Noble Machines’ robot. https://t.co/A5wbKqN6fw",
      "url": "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2123504510312300616"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1001114465692200960",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T19:51:32.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123504468822303117"
      ],
      "id": "2123504468822303117",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 1,
        "impression_count": 1339,
        "like_count": 8,
        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 1
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2123504421749526904",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Praxis-1 dramatically outperforms frontier LLMs on speed and cost. On the same station and tasks, Praxis-1 finished 15.6x faster than GPT-6 Astra driving the arm, at 51x lower cost per completed task. https://t.co/7s4JXS4KlM",
      "url": "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2123504468822303117"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1001114465692200960",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T19:51:21.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123504421749526904"
      ],
      "id": "2123504421749526904",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 10,
        "impression_count": 8730,
        "like_count": 44,
        "quote_count": 5,
        "reply_count": 14,
        "retweet_count": 5
      },
      "text": "What happens when you put a video model in control of a robot?\n\nIn episode three of Inside View, Rik Heijdens from our robotics team explains how Praxis-1 uses what a robot sees to guide its next move. https://t.co/ewop7Vxdp2",
      "url": "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2123504421749526904"
    },
