          "id": "2123460359017144769",
          "type": "quoted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Legal work is a tough test for AI. \n\nMuse Wonder earned the highest overall quality score in Legora’s November BAR benchmark for legal work. A strong showing on the kinds of complex tasks businesses need help with. https://t.co/JEJFwhGGnS",
      "url": "https://x.com/AIatMeta/status/2123484005089558692"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1799294856822673408",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T15:00:05.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123431119903461709"
      ],
      "id": "2123431119903461709",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 10,
        "impression_count": 9975,
        "like_count": 99,
        "quote_count": 17,
        "reply_count": 32,
        "retweet_count": 11
      },
      "text": "Kling 4.0 now supports native 4K resolution and 10-bit HDR output in both 4K and 1080p, bringing greater detail and richer colors to every frame. #Kling4 #KlingAI\n\nExperience the upgrade: https://t.co/FZ1BIFxpYd https://t.co/KdpYVCNhRr",
      "url": "https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2123431119903461709"
    },
